WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.720 --> 00:00:03.079
It's that time of the year again, when you head to the shops 

00:00:03.079 --> 00:00:05.439
to buy presents for family and friends... 

00:00:05.439 --> 00:00:10.600
Or maybe, like the 57% of Europeans who bought something online in 2017, 

00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:13.439
you have decided to buy gifts over the internet this year. 

00:00:14.439 --> 00:00:16.879
Ahhh, the perfect present for Uncle Erik in Stockholm...

00:00:16.879 --> 00:00:19.600
 ...But wait, why can't you buy it? 

00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:22.280
Oh! It's a Spanish website! 

00:00:22.280 --> 00:00:26.119
Denial of access to goods and services online because of your location

00:00:26.119 --> 00:00:27.319
 is called Geo-blocking. 

00:00:27.319 --> 00:00:31.519
And as of December 3 rules ending the practice are applicable. 

00:00:31.519 --> 00:00:38.839
Imagine, being in Belgium, you want to buy blue jeans from a Romanian website. 

00:00:38.839 --> 00:00:41.680
You are being redirected to your Belgian website, 

00:00:41.680 --> 00:00:43.839
because in Romania they are cheaper.

00:00:43.839 --> 00:00:46.680
 Now you will not be redirected any more. 

00:00:46.680 --> 00:00:50.720
For your own use, you can buy those jeans from cheaper websites 

00:00:50.720 --> 00:00:54.200
in different countries and nobody will prohibit you to do so. 

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:58.720
Geo-blocking is not the only form of online discrimination covered by the rules. 

00:00:58.720 --> 00:01:01.680
Not accepting credit cards from other EU countries 

00:01:01.680 --> 00:01:05.200
and not being able to register on a website based on where you live 

00:01:05.200 --> 00:01:06.920
will also come to an end... 

00:01:06.920 --> 00:01:10.239
And the legislation applies to a wide range of goods and services, 

00:01:10.239 --> 00:01:14.680
such as domestic appliances, online services like web domain hosting

00:01:14.680 --> 00:01:18.039
 and entertainment tickets for concerts or theme parks. 

00:01:18.039 --> 00:01:20.200
So this Christmas, wherever you live, 

00:01:20.200 --> 00:01:24.159
you'll no longer have any excuses for not finding the perfect present 

00:01:24.159 --> 00:01:25.639
for that special someone!

